      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the bike transport service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every bike shipment is covered by 100 % IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. The policy protects the declared value of your bike against loss or damage, and our team assists you with claim filing if any incident occurs during the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike’s location while it is in transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our container trucks are equipped with satellite GPS devices that provide live location updates. You receive a tracking link via SMS or email, allowing you to monitor the exact position of your bike from Bangalore to Kolkata.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book a bike transport from Bangalore to Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid bike registration certificate, a government‑issued ID proof, the insurance policy copy (if any), and a signed consignment note. Our team also prepares an e‑Way bill for compliance with GST regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the price for bike transport calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on the bike’s make and model, distance (approximately 2,029 km), type of packing selected, and any additional services such as doorstep pickup or expedited delivery. Our transparent quote includes all taxes, insurance, and fuel surcharges.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer door‑to‑door service for bike shipping?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we provide complete door‑to‑door service. Our team picks up the bike from your Bangalore address, loads it onto a hydraulic ramp trailer, transports it securely, and delivers it to the exact drop‑off location in Kolkata, handling all paperwork in between.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
